    <div class="itq-answer" id="itqAns10">
      <h4>Answer (Logic + Code)</h4>
      <p>Use dictionaries to map keys -&gt; indices and store values in int[,] array. Multi-parameter indexer calls Resolve().</p>
      <pre><code>public int this[string sku, string warehouse]
{
    get
    {
        var (r, c) = Resolve(sku, warehouse);                            // resolve indices
        return _stock[r, c];                                            // read from 2D array
    }
    set
    {
        if (value &lt; 0) throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(value)); // invalid stock
        var (r, c) = Resolve(sku, warehouse);                            // resolve indices
        _stock[r, c] = value;                                           // write to 2D array
    }
}</code></pre>
